{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_title", "source_sha256": "9c78b11a92d01caa3f4a9589dbcd02c6e6230d87d37e044f7fbee2f56bc48593", "ja": "スマイル☆ファンタジスタ！", "zh": "笑容☆梦幻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_synopsis", "source_sha256": "62a6525ebc2e29f0e1292dd3f0bcb15bffef2df1f6099d1bba581ab7d9690b17", "ja": "劇場内ではレッスン（サッカー）ができない\nため、公園へと向かうエレナ達。美也がはぐ\nれそうになったのをきっかけに、みんなで\n手を繋ごうとするエレナ。全員で力を合わせ\n公演を成功させよう、と決意する。", "zh": "由于在剧场里不能做训练（踢足球），\n艾琳娜一行人决定前往公园。\n途中美也差点跟大家走散，\n于是艾琳娜决定和大家手牵手，\n众人也决心要合力让公演成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cca143856dda9f5c673391ae523aef8587d81b4f8a5061960d26d44dcc75955a", "ja": "（エレナのセンター公演は、たくさんの\n笑顔と大きな拍手に包まれた中、幕を下ろした……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜的Center公演，\n在无数笑容与盛大掌声中落幕了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "5e1753a2a309921b9b61645fec4075f47477b56039ae8fe9d3b5d11d6e011cd1", "ja": "{$P$}、ただいまー！\nすっごく楽しかったー！　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，我回来了──！\n真的好开心喔──！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2ce5d7c2b117bfe61c0a86151addf60c124feaee8997d82fb73e78dc81a83712", "ja": "エレナ、お疲れさま。\nうん、いいステージだったな。", "zh": "艾琳娜，辛苦了。\n嗯，是场很棒的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "5192e68e0baf85d03719b6c0e2cdb5d1aa78daeb7ff81038ed62520226b8e3ae", "ja": "ウフフ、お客さんたちも一緒に踊っちゃってたものね。\n楽しそうな顔が、ステージの上からたくさん見えたわ♪", "zh": "呵呵，连观众们都跟着跳起舞来了呢。\n从舞台上看到了很多开心的表情喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "dbc54fd121b6b8187e7c61afc02e462b1e902d3c24508cb39ba52209efc8e02f", "ja": "みんなが、いーっぱい盛り上げてくれたからだヨ♪\nありがとー！", "zh": "多亏大家帮忙把气氛炒得火热唷♪\n谢谢你们──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "4fc335467fa8d9980d3a4d15b53a8bb23a695dba59cafa657888f6a76db8b3ca", "ja": "ううん、そうじゃないわ。\n私たちをひとつにしてくれたのは、きっと……。", "zh": "不，不是这样的。\n大家之所以能够心连心，肯定都是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "884dd4547ace36da226b3cc8e6195445851f84e354330f7ec9dd4e3af8a6aab1", "ja": "エレナさんのおかげ、ですよ～？\nそうですよね～、奈緒ちゃん。", "zh": "都是多亏了艾琳娜喔～\n你也这么觉得吧～奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "3884a0fe2941687ebc068ab70637806db5150f9d45feef1d63ac3ac3e6c77cd1", "ja": "せやな！　エレナがメッチャがんばってたから、\n私らも「負けられへん！」ってがんばれたんやで。", "zh": "嘿呀！因为见到艾琳娜奋斗的模样，\n才让我们燃起「不能输！」的心情，跟着一起努力咩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "c4ecb004f52edb805ab30dc58e8f81e824e87af7bf6da484c278a365425c6d7d", "ja": "みんな……エヘヘ。", "zh": "大家……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "5c41585bbc8f84a6f1a4a67128b14a27022fd446ccb19037b56ec972d71100e7", "ja": "……ありがとー！　ワタシ、みんなのコト大好き！\n{$P$}も大好き！　ギューッ！", "zh": "……谢谢你们～！我最喜欢大家了！\n也最喜欢{$P$}了！抱抱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2f8c10b199102e3926d1fd8ed8b752bee188c88142957f4cdb31b1e2cac12885", "ja": "こ、こら、エレナ！　抱きつかない！", "zh": "等、等等，艾琳娜！不可以抱过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "2771ce3d695c716091dd91130cd50d2b5ce0b7f10d3ead066c3dbc58cc1a0e91", "ja": "ハーイ、ごめんなさい！\nでも{$P$}、どうしよう？", "zh": "是～对不起！\n不过{$P$}，接下来怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "947685e3a3015f70b94afdf3de31576bfdc665d7d2693a31e73d44f5b4670899", "ja": "ワタシ、今ステージが終わったばっかりなのに\nなんだか踊り足りない気分だヨー。", "zh": "明明表演才刚结束而已，\n我却有种跳得不够尽兴的感觉耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1013_p", "source_sha256": "024f97a3cd34d2841aebb5b24b4a67d46fb8ae460c7493b0ec6e68aab4e779cc", "ja": "そうか。……でもそれは、\n観客席のみんなも同じ気持ちみたいだぞ。", "zh": "这样啊……不过，\n观众席的大家看起来也跟你有同样的心情喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1014_null", "source_sha256": "46916ff0e56e721daaae35b1569628199b7c21845657497927aabb8ad85d3a7b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "915be3f7899654dac047e5791e0c528d66a59836399eea4e83b037434b5553ef", "ja": "まだ終わらんといてほしいって思ってるんは、\n私らだけとちゃうみたいやな！", "zh": "看来不希望公演结束的人，\n可不只有我们呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "bcec0f4c7851785502bb56268c208c762cbc614b57b43d88f39091444257c836", "ja": "うん。今日の幕を下ろすのは、まだ早いってことかな。\n……みんな、準備はできてる？", "zh": "嗯，现在还不到落幕的时候。\n……各位，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "3dbf9a1cb92ccae760c9a708c3d16315aecb3047c09a82586c02169ff9cd77e4", "ja": "はい～。\n私なら、いつでも行けますよ～。", "zh": "没问题～\n我随时都可以上场喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "dc384871e2248871e42eb916db8ff45f680c73711ebf7ce6deba5ac18ab70c22", "ja": "さあ、エレナちゃん。\nこのまま帰るなんて言わないわよね？", "zh": "艾琳娜，\n你应该不打算就这么回去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "0d08e10e9a65ddca9201b3a5bd49d7344e92ec97e52976215cea1b339786a595", "ja": "もちろんだヨ！\n{$P$}、いいよネ！？", "zh": "那当然！\n{$P$}，可以吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ac14173b015ba9c68cca343dde1c551bc7c81c04bbc709c4aae94e98b3f22d3d", "ja": "ああ、行ってこい！\nお客さんが、みんなを待ってるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，去吧！\n观众们都在等你们喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "896f972f56b4fa2870d5d2b08aa5fc717bc8dd6d9e5ece5534a2130887d287bc", "ja": "ハーイ！　それじゃみんな、手をつなごっ♪\nカーニバルは終わらないヨー！", "zh": "好～那么大家，把手牵起来吧♪\n嘉年华是不会结束的唷──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2c8f705a36bb8e81a1324c006d89ef6e4f0210f5e7a34d8628f1fb055a0154aa", "ja": "（エレナの、そしてみんなの、お客さんの笑顔が、\n心をひとつに繋いでいく……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜与大家的笑容，还有观众的笑容，\n将所有的心连系在一起……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_022_1023_p", "source_sha256": "876c452b18b98639e210680858ddfe1f0449dc96e5068acb4dce2eda44ca21cf", "ja": "（みんなの笑顔が作り上げた絆が、\nこれからもステージに魔法をかけ続けるだろう！）", "zh": "（大家的笑容所创造出的羁绊，\n今后也会继续在舞台上施展魔法吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
